Z||000000||N_Man||02-16-2001||06:38 PM||||Well eariler today i was coming home and an integra type-R pulled up. well he gives me a look i nod... The light turns green we both nail it I smoked him till about 100kph then he starts to gain and by 140 he passes me.<BR>well next light im behind him because there is a van so he nails it smokes his tires as a cop pulls of the merge ramp. i see the cop just drive away from the light normally.  the integra gets pulled over, i look to my buddy and say i feel bad for him cause we were just having fun.<P>well i get home and no more then an hour later the cop rings my bell... ticket for racing 172 bucks and 6 demerits... the cop even said he didnt see me do anything wrong but he had to give me the ticket beacuse the ass that i felt bad for said we were racing.<P>anyways im gonna fight this one for sure, but it seems totally rediculas to me sure i was racing at the last light and sure the cop saw the integra take off like stink in the wind but didnt see me do anything wrong.  But integra boy was pissed that he got pulled over and had to say why didnt you pull him over he was racing me...<P>well hada vent, just think about it racing is fun but the consiquences really suck||||reg||8
